       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Plays a role in the regulation of contractile properties of both striated and smooth muscles. When unphosphorylated, may inhibit myosin dephosphorylation. Phosphorylation at Ser-299 reduces this inhibitory activity (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
