       {
        "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
       }
      ],
      "value": "Colocalizes with MYH2. In its unphosphorylated state, localizes to the cytoplasm (By similarity). Phosphorylation at Ser-301 promotes translocation to the nucleus (By similarity)"
     }
    ]
   },
